Let S be a timelike hypersurface of (M, g). Let n be a unit normal field to S and let hab be the induced metric on S. Let χab be the second fundamental form on S and let σab be the trace-free part of χab. Then the following are equivalent:

• S is a photon surface;

• χab k^a k^b =0 null k ∈ TpS p ∈ S;

• σab=0;

• every affine null geodesic of (S, h) is an affine null geodesic of (M, g).

